### Feature Consultation — GET ALL / GET ONE
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1
@token = 
# @name getAllConsultations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consultas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# @name getOneConsultation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consultas/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
